#39902
The Model Home~
  Welcome to the Newest Option now provided to all Raven Players,
The Personal Home.
For the small sum of 100,000,000 coin you to can own your own
home.
You will receive:
1. Door for Privacy
2. Peace flag for security.
3. Locker for storage.
4. Regen flag for comfort.
  Each House will be personalized to the owners own descriptions.
You can have your house built in any section of mud with the stipulation
that houses fit the "theme" of the area. In other words, no one will
have a house in Xerx's treasure room, or anyone elses.
  Get them while you can!
~
