suddenly rolls back, leaving the cave pitch black.  Red eye's peer out of the
darkness at you, snarling and hissing, perhaps you shouldn't have come here!  
As you panic and fumble your small light source you feel a chilling breath
crawl past your neck.  Before you can even react and turn around a large mass
of darkness smashes you in the face, knocking you down
