#39950
&08The Slaughterhouse&00~
   You enter a large courtyard surrounded by a picketed gate outside of the
Slaughterhouse.  Relatively well maintained, Thog uses this area to relax after
preparing meats within the Slaughterhouse.  You immediately feel very
uncomfortable in this place.  There is a picnic table in the center of the
courtyard where Thog seems to be resting after a long morning of cleaving.  
Carved in the picnic table is the minotaur motto, "Eat more chicken" as chicken
is the primary product of this Slaughterhouse.  You suddenly realize there may
be other white meats prepared inside and start to feel very uneasy.  Thog slowly
starts to rise, grabs his cleaver Gryendel, and lumbers toward you.
~
