#39990
&07A vast underground crypt&00~
   Stretching out in all directions this underground crypt is a sight to behold.
Tombstones of all sizes, some weathered and cracked, litter this lifeless
landscape.  Long dead vines and roots hang down from the ceiling as if trying to
capture anything living in their grasp.  They also serve as an acoustical
suppressant.  It is so quiet that you can hear your own &08blood&00 pumping through
your veins.  You have stumbled into the lair of the great necromancer, &10Atrophy&00.
~
